{"id":465,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Draped with long vines, it resembles a shrub in appearance. It swings bundles of vines as though they were arms, wrapping them around prey to ensnare them."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Vine growth is accelerated for Tangrowth living in warm climates. If the vines grow long, Tangrowth shortens them by tearing parts of them off."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Tangrowth has two arms that it can extend as it pleases. Recent research has shown that these arms are, in fact, bundles of vines."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","SoulSilver"],"text":"Its vines grow so profusely that, in the warm season, you can’t even see its eyes."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It ensnares prey by extending arms made of vines. Losing arms to predators does not trouble it."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Even if one of its arms is eaten, it’s fine. The Pokémon regenerates quickly and will go right back to normal."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"Its arms are made of plants that bind themselves to things. They grow back right away if cut."},{"games":["HeartGold"],"text":"When it remains still, it appears to be a large shrub. Unsuspecting prey that wander near get ensnared by its vines."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Chlorophyll","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Speed stat in harsh sunlight."},{"name":"Leaf Guard","hidden":false,"description":"Prevents status conditions in harsh sunlight."},{"name":"Regenerator","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon has a little of its HP restored when withdrawn from battle."}],"eggGroups":["Grass"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Blue","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":114,"name":"Tangela","condition":null,"children":[{"id":465,"name":"Tangrowth","condition":"Level up, knowing Ancient Power","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,20],[1,71],[1,74],[1,78],[1,335],[12,72],[16,22],[20,77],[24,246],[28,282],[32,202],[36,79],[40,21],[44,321],[48,438],[52,275],[56,580]],"machine":[133,213,34,280,693,523,331,89,203,412,263,374,411,202,416,447,580,63,437,371,398,384,438,182,115,156,157,317,496,402,214,188,173,76,669,707,164,241,14,168],"egg":[],"tutor":[803]},"cards":[{"id":"me1-7","name":"Tangrowth","set":"Mega Evolution","date":"2025-09-26","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"7","artist":null,"img":"me1/7"},{"id":"sv6-2","name":"Tangrowth","set":"Twilight Masquerade","date":"2024-05-24","rarity":"Common","number":"2","artist":"LINNE","img":"sv6/2"},{"id":"swsh12pt5-5","name":"Tangrowth","set":"Crown Zenith","date":"2023-01-20","rarity":"Rare","number":"5","artist":"zig","img":"swsh12pt5/5"},{"id":"sm12-6","name":"Tangrowth","set":"Cosmic Eclipse","date":"2019-11-01","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"6","artist":"nagimiso","img":"sm12/6"},{"id":"sm10-17","name":"Tangrowth","set":"Unbroken Bonds","date":"2019-05-03","rarity":"Rare","number":"17","artist":"kodama","img":"sm10/17"},{"id":"sm8-2","name":"Tangrowth","set":"Lost Thunder","date":"2018-11-02","rarity":"Rare","number":"2","artist":"Atsuko Nishida","img":"sm8/2"},{"id":"sm3-8","name":"Tangrowth","set":"Burning Shadows","date":"2017-08-05","rarity":"Rare","number":"8","artist":"tetsuya koizumi","img":"sm3/8"},{"id":"xy11-2","name":"Tangrowth","set":"Steam Siege","date":"2016-08-03","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"2","artist":"kirisAki","img":"xy11/2"},{"id":"xy5-5","name":"Tangrowth","set":"Primal Clash","date":"2015-02-04","rarity":"Rare","number":"5","artist":"MAHOU","img":"xy5/5"},{"id":"bw11-2","name":"Tangrowth","set":"Legendary Treasures","date":"2013-11-06","rarity":"Rare","number":"2","artist":"Kagemaru Himeno","img":"bw11/2"},{"id":"bw7-6","name":"Tangrowth","set":"Boundaries Crossed","date":"2012-11-07","rarity":"Rare Holo","number":"6","artist":"TOKIYA","img":"bw7/6"},{"id":"col1-34","name":"Tangrowth","set":"Call of Legends","date":"2011-02-09","rarity":"Rare","num